9. Let the applicant- Neeraj Pandey @ Neeraj Kumar Pandey be released on bail in Case Crime No.
386 of 2022, under Sections 406, 420, 467, 468, 471, 504 I.P.C., registered at Police Station Mahanagar, District Lucknow, on furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of Magistrate/Court concerned, subject to the following conditions: -
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.
10.

